  "description": [
    "320 pages ; 21 cm",
    "The advice in 500 Things Every Teen Should Know Before Leaving Home ranges from nitty-gritty information about everyday living to wise counsel for successfully navigating relationships and social situations. Among the topics covered are financial matters, cooking, moving and leasing, emergency situations, etiquette, job hunting, household chores, and adult relationships. Each tip is written in clear, easy-to-follow language, and Fast Facts that are scattered throughout the book give quick bursts of additional information on things like laundry, acne, and recycling"
  ],
